---
import ExampleCodeViewer from '@/components/code/ExampleCodeViewer.astro';
import BasicDialog from './Examples/BasicDialog.astro';
import BasicDialogCode from './Examples/BasicDialog.astro?raw';

interface Props {
  id?: string;
  class?: string;
}

const { id, class: className } = Astro.props;
// Welcome to Astro! Wondering what to do next? Check out the Astro documentation at https://docs.astro.build
// Don't want to use any of this? Delete everything in this file, the `assets`, `components`, and `layouts` directories, and start fresh.
---

<div id={id} class={className}>
  <h2>Dialog</h2>
  <p class="sub-comment">
    Dialog는 모달과 비슷하지만, 모달보다는 단순한 알림을 위한 컴포넌트입니다.
  </p>
  <ExampleCodeViewer
    component={BasicDialog}
    code={BasicDialogCode}
    js={`
    /*

    다이얼로그는 정적(static) 함수 호출에 의해 생성되는 팝업으로, 모달과는 다르게 팝업이 클로징된 이후에 
    접근성을 위한 focus 처리를 직접적으로 해야 합니다. (then으로 이어지는 함수에서)
    
    Dialog.Alert({title,message,animation,btnLabel)
    title: string,
    message: string,
    animation?: boolean = true,
    btnLabel?: string = 'OK',

    return Promise<void>


    Dialog.Confirm({title,message,animation,btnLabel,btnLabelCancel})
    title: string,
    message: string,
    animation?: boolean = true,
    btnLabel?: string = 'OK',
    btnLabelCancel?: string = 'Cancel',

    return Promise<void>

    */
   
    Dialog.Alert({
      title: 'Alert',
      message: 'Alert message',
      btnLabel: 'OK',
    }).then((res) => {
      console.log('result', res);
    })
    
    Dialog.Confirm({
      title: 'Confirm',
      message: 'Confirm message',
      btnLabel: 'OK',
      btnLabelCancel: 'Cancel',
    }).then((res) => {
      console.log('result', res);
    });

    `}
  />
</div>
